name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q12_2025'

question 'A fitness tracker gives you a "Workout Complete!" badge only if you finish 10,000 steps and log a stretching session. What kind of logic is the app using to decide when to award the badge?'

right 'It uses an AND operator to check that both conditions are true.'
wrong 'It uses an OR operator so only one condition has to be true.'
wrong 't shows the badge randomly to keep users surprised.'
wrong 'It skips checking conditions and just adds badges every day.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

